WEBVTT

00:08.875 --> 00:16.916
Shiroi mikazuki machi wo miorosu koro ni

00:16.916 --> 00:24.914
Aoi meikyuu kara mashou ga mezame-hajimeru

00:32.432 --> 00:36.236
Tsumibukai kono chijou de, boy

00:36.236 --> 00:39.239
Believing, dreaming

00:39.239 --> 00:43.076
Boku-tachi wa sagashiteru

00:43.076 --> 00:48.207
Tamashii no mezasubeki basho wo

00:50.016 --> 00:58.425
Ah, dore kurai fukai yami hikari ni kaetara

00:58.425 --> 01:02.996
Sekai no iro ga kawaru?

01:02.996 --> 01:05.665
Ah, itsuka kitto

01:05.665 --> 01:13.940
Ah, dore kurai fukai nazo ikutsumo toitara

01:13.940 --> 01:18.900
Rakuen no doa wa hiraku?

01:20.447 --> 01:27.080
Bokura no tabi wo start hajimeyou

01:34.160 --> 01:36.287
No!

01:45.772 --> 01:48.741
Walking alone at night is dangerous, missy.

01:51.878 --> 01:52.612
Beware of
pursesnatchers

01:52.612 --> 01:52.812
Beware of
pursesnatchers
Who are you?!

01:52.812 --> 01:54.507
Who are you?!

01:57.383 --> 01:59.817
I have no name to give to villains.

02:13.600 --> 02:15.702
Thank you so much!

02:15.702 --> 02:16.760
Loki.

02:17.604 --> 02:19.071
Do you know of Loki?

02:19.873 --> 02:21.341
Uh, no.

02:21.341 --> 02:22.638
I see...

02:23.076 --> 02:24.566
Be careful on your way home.

02:25.478 --> 02:26.775
Wait!

02:27.113 --> 02:29.581
Um, would you tell me your name?

02:31.818 --> 02:34.787
Inazuma Ramen

02:35.622 --> 02:39.319
I'm merely an ally of justice who
happened to be passing by.

02:47.133 --> 02:52.765
The 2nd Night
The Allies of Justice are Totally Broke?!

03:04.918 --> 03:06.283
Banished?!

03:07.587 --> 03:10.556
You're banishing me to the world of humans?

03:18.965 --> 03:20.133
Why?

03:20.133 --> 03:21.100
Odin!

03:23.603 --> 03:26.272
I swear I'll come back here,
to the world of the gods.

03:26.272 --> 03:27.569
I swear it!

03:48.194 --> 03:49.991
Yakisoba Secret Technique:

03:55.835 --> 03:57.029
Niagara!

04:07.080 --> 04:08.815
Hey, all you first-years!

04:08.815 --> 04:14.276
The Mystery Society is giving free
yakisoba to all new recruits!

04:15.188 --> 04:17.315
Get a plate with a skull on it and
you win another helping!

04:17.657 --> 04:20.490
Come on, everyone! Let's mystery!

04:22.195 --> 04:24.364
Sorry, Yamino.

04:24.364 --> 04:26.666
I had you make so much, but...

04:26.666 --> 04:29.032
It's perfectly all right. Don't worry!

04:29.369 --> 04:31.564
I know exactly why they didn't eat it.

04:32.639 --> 04:33.506
Mystery Yakisoba

04:33.506 --> 04:34.540
Hey, Daidoji.

04:35.208 --> 04:36.539
Kotaro?

04:36.843 --> 04:40.506
With the way things are going, it seems you'll
be your club's only member this year too.

04:41.080 --> 04:43.516
So if you have any sympathy, join us!

04:43.516 --> 04:45.485
I'll give you enough yakisoba for ten people!

04:45.485 --> 04:46.786
No thanks!

04:46.786 --> 04:48.021
I'd much rather spend my time...

04:48.021 --> 04:49.022
Let's go over there next!

04:49.022 --> 04:50.523
Okay, let's go!

04:50.523 --> 04:53.059
With women rather than mysteries.

04:53.059 --> 04:56.256
Hey, you! You're pretty cute.
Wanna go out with me?

04:57.397 --> 04:58.731
He's so rude!

04:58.731 --> 05:02.189
How could he say that with a super beautiful girl,
namely me, standing right in front of him?

05:17.483 --> 05:18.951
Secret Technique:

05:18.951 --> 05:21.419
Takoyaki Galaxy!

05:22.121 --> 05:23.956
Totally galactic!

05:23.956 --> 05:26.993
Takoyaki

05:26.993 --> 05:27.126
Takoyaki
Hey! It's that guy!

05:27.126 --> 05:28.828
Hey! It's that guy!

05:28.828 --> 05:30.363
An acquaintance of yours?

05:30.363 --> 05:33.423
Yeah. He's new.
He just transferred into my class.

05:33.733 --> 05:35.234
Hey, Narugami!

05:35.234 --> 05:37.337
Hey, what's up, uh...

05:37.337 --> 05:39.238
Mayura Daidoji!

05:39.238 --> 05:41.407
Are you starting your own club too?

05:41.407 --> 05:43.242
Nope, this is just part-time work.

05:43.242 --> 05:44.077
Part-time work?

05:44.077 --> 05:45.978
Living on your own costs money, you know...

05:45.978 --> 05:50.316
Even if it is in a tiny, rundown apartment
with communal water and bathrooms.

05:50.316 --> 05:52.910
Oh, I see! You're poor!

05:53.219 --> 05:55.321
Uh, that's a little harsh, Mayura!

05:55.321 --> 05:59.417
I'm so busy with my jobs that I don't even have
time for my manhunt, let alone clubs.

06:00.059 --> 06:01.253
Manhunt?

06:04.364 --> 06:05.698
Say, by the way...

06:05.698 --> 06:08.997
You're always carrying that wooden sword
around, aren't you?

06:09.702 --> 06:12.193
That's my partner, Mjolnir.

06:12.372 --> 06:13.639
I get it!

06:13.639 --> 06:16.175
You're after some guy to get revenge on him!

06:16.175 --> 06:17.477
Ooh, a mystery!

06:17.477 --> 06:19.342
It's none of your business!

06:19.645 --> 06:22.548
What's the big deal? It's not like
it'd hurt you to tell me!

06:22.548 --> 06:23.845
C'mon, Yamino. Let's go.

06:29.155 --> 06:30.281
This feeling...

06:34.026 --> 06:35.628
Why?

06:35.628 --> 06:38.324
When I look at Narugami,
I can feel his fear.

06:39.065 --> 06:40.259
Mystery Yakisoba

06:40.333 --> 06:42.268
Ah, he's so cute!

06:42.268 --> 06:43.565
Look this way!

06:44.570 --> 06:46.094
Now what?

06:48.574 --> 06:50.810
His hair's so soft and fluffy!

06:50.810 --> 06:51.777
Loki!
Master Loki!

06:52.979 --> 06:54.105
Loki?!

06:55.481 --> 06:56.641
What was that?

06:56.949 --> 06:59.679
He's SO cute! I wanna take him home!

07:00.420 --> 07:02.922
You girls are much cuter than I am!

07:02.922 --> 07:05.220
I think I'm gonna faint!

07:05.558 --> 07:08.356
Oh, for crying out loud!
He's such a little womanizer!

07:09.695 --> 07:10.821
Loki!

07:11.230 --> 07:12.356
Hey there, Mayura!

07:12.632 --> 07:14.259
C'mon, we're going!

07:14.400 --> 07:16.169
See you later!
Er, thanks, okay...

07:16.169 --> 07:18.304
What do they mean, "See you later"?!

07:18.304 --> 07:20.795
I've been waiting for you this whole time!

07:21.574 --> 07:23.276
See you later, sir!

07:23.276 --> 07:24.903
See you again sometime!

07:29.816 --> 07:31.943
But they were brand new.

07:33.953 --> 07:37.857
We'll now be starting our
"Seven Wonders of the School" tour!

07:37.857 --> 07:39.625
Seven Wonders of
the School Tour
Seven Wonders of the School?

07:39.625 --> 07:42.361
Seven Wonders of
the School Tour
That's right! And we're going to
take pictures of them.

07:42.361 --> 07:44.664
Once people realize there really
are mysteries here,

07:44.664 --> 07:46.866
they'll all come running to
join our club for sure!

07:46.866 --> 07:49.035
Don't call me for things like this.

07:49.035 --> 07:50.736
It's not like I have a whole lot of free time.

07:50.736 --> 07:52.863
Okay! Right this way, please!

07:55.675 --> 07:57.510
Mystery #1:

07:57.510 --> 07:58.977
"The Dancing Skeleton"

08:01.147 --> 08:04.275
See? It moved!
It's a strange mystery!

08:07.353 --> 08:08.521
I don't think so.

08:08.521 --> 08:10.022
It's a draft that's causing this.

08:10.022 --> 08:11.148
See?

08:11.724 --> 08:16.024
Whenever that door is open, the wind blows
through and rattles the skeleton.

08:16.629 --> 08:18.464
No way!

08:18.464 --> 08:20.762
So it's not a mystery?

08:22.268 --> 08:23.436
Mystery #2:

08:23.436 --> 08:25.427
"The Composer with the Runny Nose"

08:27.373 --> 08:29.671
It's just a stain on the wall.

08:32.378 --> 08:33.646
Mystery #3:

08:33.646 --> 08:35.443
"The Cursed Volleyball"

08:36.148 --> 08:38.275
It's got 13 spots on it!

08:40.853 --> 08:42.445
It's just dirty.

08:47.460 --> 08:48.861
Mystery #4:

08:48.861 --> 08:51.330
"The Enigmatic Ground Drawings
Outside the School Building"

08:51.330 --> 08:52.957
It's that guy's fault.

08:59.105 --> 09:00.504
Library

09:01.207 --> 09:02.508
Mystery #5:

09:02.508 --> 09:05.500
"The Bookshelves Where the Books
Change Places Before You Know lt"

09:11.784 --> 09:14.053
The shelves just fall over easily.

09:14.053 --> 09:16.954
People put the books back in a rush
and get them out of order.

09:19.559 --> 09:20.860
Mystery #6:

09:20.860 --> 09:22.657
"The Toilet Stall that Won't Open"

09:23.863 --> 09:24.989
It opens.

09:46.586 --> 09:49.555
How come you can figure all
this stuff out, Loki?

09:50.356 --> 09:53.526
You've convinced yourself that some
uninteresting things are mysteries.

09:53.526 --> 09:56.984
That's the typical pattern these
"Seven Wonders" stories follow.

09:58.598 --> 10:00.623
Loki... Who in the world are you?

10:01.667 --> 10:03.464
I'm just me.

10:06.072 --> 10:08.040
It's about time I was leaving.

10:08.741 --> 10:09.867
Just a second!

10:11.177 --> 10:14.413
Don't you think the last of the
mysteries might be for real?

10:14.413 --> 10:17.541
Look, true mysteries just aren't
that common, all right?

10:29.996 --> 10:30.963
Mayura!

10:39.605 --> 10:42.506
What was that? What's going on?

10:45.911 --> 10:47.003
Mayura!

10:49.815 --> 10:50.950
This is...

10:50.950 --> 10:53.009
Are you all right?

10:53.552 --> 10:56.222
Yeah, I'm okay.

10:56.222 --> 10:57.657
What happened here?

10:57.657 --> 10:59.925
This suit of armor attacked me
all of a sudden.

10:59.925 --> 11:01.222
A suit of armor?

11:02.728 --> 11:04.696
I said there were seven wonders.

11:05.564 --> 11:08.434
"The Cursed Suit of Armor that
Wanders the School..."

11:08.434 --> 11:11.335
is the seventh mystery.

11:52.445 --> 11:56.404
Long, long ago, there was a count who
had been possessed by a devil.

11:56.916 --> 11:58.884
Every night, he would hunt down
pretty young girls, and...

12:05.024 --> 12:09.324
Supposedly, he wore that suit of armor.

12:12.732 --> 12:15.801
I'll bet you the count's angry spirit
has possessed that armor!

12:15.801 --> 12:19.105
Now he's wandering the school,
seeking another victim.

12:19.105 --> 12:20.902
It's a strange mystery!

12:22.208 --> 12:23.442
Is it evil?

12:23.442 --> 12:24.409
You could say that.

12:26.812 --> 12:27.513
Master Loki!

12:27.513 --> 12:29.981
This way. Mayura!
Stay with us, all right?

12:30.249 --> 12:32.985
It chopped those shoe shelves right in two!

12:32.985 --> 12:37.456
And that girl said it didn't seem like
there was anyone inside the armor!

12:37.456 --> 12:40.050
This is it, for sure...

12:40.459 --> 12:42.927
A strange mystery! Right, guys?

12:44.964 --> 12:45.760
Huh?

12:47.967 --> 12:49.662
There's no one here.

12:54.039 --> 12:56.064
Yamino, where's Mayura?

13:03.816 --> 13:04.646
Theater Club Storeroom

13:07.486 --> 13:08.783
Loki?

13:11.791 --> 13:13.088
No!

13:15.861 --> 13:18.159
Don't come near me! Don't touch me!

13:21.734 --> 13:24.032
Sheesh, it's only a mannequin.

13:25.938 --> 13:28.736
I wonder where Mayura went?

13:41.153 --> 13:43.121
Don't scare me like that!

13:46.025 --> 13:48.994
Hmph! I'm not gonna let
anything else fool me.

13:50.729 --> 13:52.196
The armor!

13:53.999 --> 13:55.864
Don't kill me!

14:02.608 --> 14:04.838
It's not moving?

14:07.780 --> 14:09.782
Thank goodness...

14:09.782 --> 14:11.684
Er, I mean, that's no good at all!

14:11.684 --> 14:14.653
I have to snap a photo of it
while it's moving!

14:14.653 --> 14:16.120
Hey, c'mon! Move!

14:16.488 --> 14:18.115
Mayura!

14:19.758 --> 14:21.726
Mayura!

14:22.561 --> 14:25.758
Please, Master Loki.
You help out too! Come, now!

14:28.100 --> 14:30.830
Mayura!

14:53.926 --> 14:55.393
Narugami!

14:58.230 --> 15:00.858
Don't go choosing the wrong opponent!

15:06.872 --> 15:08.941
Thanks, Narugami!

15:08.941 --> 15:10.738
But what are you doing here?

15:11.477 --> 15:12.501
Go home!

15:13.412 --> 15:14.914
Don't stay here any longer!

15:14.914 --> 15:16.211
Go home immediately!

15:24.456 --> 15:25.753
Mayura!

15:28.761 --> 15:29.728
Mayura!

15:34.266 --> 15:35.893
Narugami?

15:36.268 --> 15:37.436
That's right!

15:37.436 --> 15:40.739
He came just in the nick of time,
and chased the armor away.

15:40.739 --> 15:43.075
He's just so cool!

15:43.075 --> 15:44.343
Now I see.

15:44.343 --> 15:50.282
What I felt as fear must actually have
been Narugami's strength.

15:50.282 --> 15:53.319
Did you say you felt fear?

15:53.319 --> 15:54.445
Yes.

15:55.287 --> 15:56.889
How interesting...

15:56.889 --> 15:59.658
Someone could scare you, huh?

15:59.658 --> 16:01.216
Narugami...

16:01.527 --> 16:03.762
Look, the armor is the real problem here!

16:03.762 --> 16:06.230
If we don't do something,
this could turn into a disaster!

16:07.066 --> 16:08.363
You're right.

16:09.034 --> 16:12.834
I'm tired of this game of hide and seek.
It's about time we meet face-to-face.

16:13.339 --> 16:16.467
Mayura, there's a little something
I'd like you to help us out with.

16:16.675 --> 16:18.040
Help out with?

16:34.927 --> 16:36.394
Just as I thought!

16:41.633 --> 16:43.726
It's all right now, Yamino.

16:50.242 --> 16:53.075
It's not pretty young girls
you're after at all.

16:55.114 --> 16:58.572
You've been after me the whole time.

17:00.386 --> 17:02.013
Why have you come to this world?

17:35.888 --> 17:39.525
A tool's true power is realized
only when it is used.

17:39.525 --> 17:41.823
The moment you tried to become the user...

17:42.361 --> 17:43.658
You were defeated!

17:52.237 --> 17:53.534
Master Loki!

17:54.039 --> 17:55.040
Huh?

17:55.040 --> 17:57.008
The armor's all in pieces.

18:00.379 --> 18:01.846
Don't touch it, Mayura!

18:12.224 --> 18:14.226
Master Loki, that sword...

18:14.226 --> 18:15.861
It's the Demon Sword, Gram.

18:15.861 --> 18:18.830
Also known as the Demon Sword of Volsung!

18:23.469 --> 18:25.704
Please, stop it, Mayura!

18:25.704 --> 18:28.832
It's no use! Mayura can't hear us now.

18:33.912 --> 18:36.548
Its moves are completely
different from before.

18:36.548 --> 18:39.847
If only I weren't trapped in this form,
I'd be able to use my magic as I please!

18:49.128 --> 18:50.254
Master Loki!

19:13.152 --> 19:14.449
Master Loki!

19:33.739 --> 19:36.105
So you are this "Narugami"...

19:36.475 --> 19:38.102
Eh, Naru-kami?

19:38.944 --> 19:41.640
Master Loki, you know him?

19:42.214 --> 19:44.116
You should know him too.

19:44.116 --> 19:48.416
The god of Scandinavia, brandishing
his mighty hammer Mjolnir.

19:48.554 --> 19:51.022
Thor, the god of thunder?!

19:56.895 --> 19:58.692
Is it by order of Odin?

19:59.698 --> 20:03.896
I know you, Loki, and I have
no reason to kill you.

20:04.469 --> 20:07.165
I see you're as soft as ever.

20:07.706 --> 20:09.241
Ah, shaddup.

20:09.241 --> 20:12.904
Loki, tell me how to get back
to the world of the gods.

20:14.413 --> 20:17.871
I'm afraid I don't know. I was exiled.

20:18.183 --> 20:19.150
What?!

20:23.121 --> 20:24.823
Oh, well. No biggie!

20:24.823 --> 20:27.291
At least I have that new part-time job.

20:28.026 --> 20:29.194
Part-time job?

20:29.194 --> 20:31.763
Thunder God Okonomiyaki

20:31.763 --> 20:32.764
Thunder God Okonomiyaki
Secret Technique:

20:32.764 --> 20:33.665
Thunder God Okonomiyaki
Okonomiyaki Twisting Lunar Somersault!

20:33.665 --> 20:35.257
Okonomiyaki Twisting Lunar Somersault!

20:38.403 --> 20:42.307
I never was able to capture any
of the seven wonders on film.

20:42.307 --> 20:46.078
Now I'm gonna be the only person in the
Mystery Society again this year.

20:46.078 --> 20:47.375
Gloomsville!

20:47.813 --> 20:49.681
Cheer up, Daidoji!

20:49.681 --> 20:50.816
Here.

20:50.816 --> 20:53.151
Thanks! You're treating me?

20:53.151 --> 20:55.142
Of course not! You'll have to pay.

20:56.822 --> 20:58.323
Here ya go, Four-Eyes.

20:58.323 --> 21:00.292
Thank you very much!

21:00.292 --> 21:02.060
Thanks for the food!

21:02.060 --> 21:03.891
Sure thing!
Make sure to get seconds!

21:04.630 --> 21:06.198
It's so good!

21:06.198 --> 21:07.324
Yamino.

21:09.034 --> 21:12.492
Odin is trying to destroy me.

21:15.941 --> 21:17.309
Why?

21:17.309 --> 21:19.470
Why would he try to kill me?

21:22.114 --> 21:23.448
How 'bout that, Loki?

21:23.448 --> 21:25.643
You eat up too, and help boost my sales!

21:29.621 --> 21:30.956
By the way...

21:30.956 --> 21:34.092
Why are you always wearing
that kind of uniform?

21:34.092 --> 21:36.094
Our school's uniform is a blazer!

21:36.094 --> 21:39.393
Yes, well, the traditional uniform is
most appropriate for students!

21:42.267 --> 21:44.064
Who do you think you are, laughing?

21:46.438 --> 21:47.839
Uh, Narugami?

21:47.839 --> 21:48.965
Your hand...

21:52.477 --> 21:54.945
Yeow, that's hot!

22:17.235 --> 22:29.204
Fukai kiri wo saite tsukiakari ga terashita michi

22:30.882 --> 22:42.627
Daremo mina mayoinagara,
samayotteru ashita e to

22:42.627 --> 22:49.835
Kodoku no machi de kataritsugu shinwa sae

22:49.835 --> 22:56.174
Habamaresou na yami wo nukete yuku

22:56.174 --> 23:05.684
Hatenai sora wo koete tabi wo shite iru

23:05.684 --> 23:10.021
Kizutsuitemo

23:10.021 --> 23:22.033
Boku-tachi wa kitto tadoritsukeru kara,
inori-tsuzuketai

23:22.033 --> 23:23.762
Believe in Heaven

23:31.510 --> 23:32.677
Next Episode

23:32.677 --> 23:36.448
Next Episode
The next episode's keywords are,
"bird nest," "beautiful girl," and "assassin."

23:36.448 --> 23:38.450
Next Episode
Ooh, ooh! Pretty girl, right here!

23:38.450 --> 23:39.117
Next Episode
Who?

23:39.117 --> 23:42.521
Next Episode
Me! Mayura Daidoji, 17 years old,
in the springtime of my youth!

23:42.521 --> 23:43.688
Next Episode
Is that right?

23:43.688 --> 23:44.756
Next Episode

23:44.756 --> 23:48.493
Next Episode
Hey, who is this little boy anyhow?
Someone you know, Loki?

23:48.493 --> 23:50.662
Next Episode
My name is Heimdall.

23:50.662 --> 23:52.597
Next Episode
He... Hey...

23:52.597 --> 23:54.599
Next Episode
Hey, taxi!

23:54.599 --> 23:55.031
Next Episode

23:55.233 --> 23:55.700
The Mythical Detective Loki Ragnarok,

23:55.700 --> 23:57.068
The 3rd Night
The Assassin Descends!
The Mythical Detective Loki Ragnarok,

23:57.068 --> 23:58.470
The 3rd Night
The Assassin Descends!
"The Assassin Descends!"

23:58.470 --> 24:00.639
The 3rd Night
The Assassin Descends!
Now, that sounds like a strange mystery!

24:00.639 --> 24:01.367
The 3rd Night
The Assassin Descends!
